      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidation testing of HEAs at approximately 900–1100 °C in air is applicable to high-temperature oxidation behavior.",
